The zusvg package bundles copies of the plutosvg and plutovg C libraries.
zusvg, plutosvg and plutovg are distributed under the MIT licence. plutovg
contains code derived from FreeType, under the FreeType Licence, and the stb
single-file libraries, under the MIT licence or in the public domain at the
user's choice. Each licence applies to its own files.


zusvg
=====

Copyright (c) 2026 zusvg authors

Covers everything in the package except src/vendor/. Full text in
LICENSE.md in the source repository; CRAN's YEAR/COPYRIGHT HOLDER form is
in LICENSE.


plutosvg and plutovg
====================

Copyright (c) 2020-2026 Samuel Ugochukwu. MIT licence.

Bundled in src/vendor/plutosvg/ and src/vendor/plutovg/, at the release
tags, commits and archive checksums recorded in src/vendor/PROVENANCE, with
the patches listed there.


