Portions of this software are copyright (C) 1996-2020 The FreeType Project
(www.freetype.org). All rights reserved. FreeType Licence.

src/vendor/plutovg/source/plutovg-ft-*.{c,h}; the licence text is in
src/vendor/plutovg/source/FTL.TXT.


stb
===

stb_image, stb_image_write and stb_truetype, by Sean Barrett and
contributors. MIT licence or public domain, at the user's choice.

src/vendor/plutovg/source/plutovg-stb-*.h; the licence text is at the end
of each file.


All notices are collected in inst/COPYRIGHTS.
